"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nA short story with no fluff. It's short but intense, impactful, and has deep resonance.  \n\nIn the book, it's expressed as an artist and a critic, but this duality exists everywhere.  \nIt shows the reality where depth becomes a yardstick for measuring the depth of life, and  gradually eat away at even individual lives.  \n\nThis yardstick is also applied to oneself.  \nIt seems that the yardstick one applies can turn into development or into despair.\n"